(7671475, 1252523, 50864, '<td valign="top">Wish I had a laughing emoji to put here. <br/> <br/>Backstory:Marj grabbed the wrong copy of her entry (the un straightened horizon copy) then she injured her eye with her exercise band and needed laser surgery to repair the retina. When the dust cleared she was horrified that the wrong copy went live and to make matters worse it is scoring in the mid 7s so she will have to look at the crooked horizon on her front page for the rest of her life. ROTFL Marj Im glad you have two good eyes to see the crooked horizon. <br/>This is still beautiful. Congratulations!<br/> <br/>Not voting on this</td>', 'Wish I had a laughing emoji to put here.  Backstory:Marj grabbed the wrong copy of her entry (the un straightened horizon copy) then she injured her eye with her exercise band and needed laser surgery to repair the retina. When the dust cleared she was horrified that the wrong copy went live and to make matters worse it is scoring in the mid 7s so she will have to look at the crooked horizon on her front page for the rest of her life. ROTFL Marj Im glad you have two good eyes to see the crooked horizon. This is still beautiful. Congratulations! Not voting on this', '2020-08-03 17:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
