(7671617, 1252523, 42013, '<td valign="top">9 from me, didnt notice your horizon and Im usually pretty sticky about horizons. Landforms can play tricks with horizons and on further review, it still doesnt jump out to me(although it is visible). Congrats on your ribbon. I visited Glacier for the first time last summer and Ive been scheming to return since the day we left.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-08-05 01:22:20.</i></td>', '9 from me, didnt notice your horizon and Im usually pretty sticky about horizons. Landforms can play tricks with horizons and on further review, it still doesnt jump out to me(although it is visible). Congrats on your ribbon. I visited Glacier for the first time last summer and Ive been scheming to return since the day we left.', '2020-08-05 02:20:54.000000', '2020-08-05 02:22:20.000000', 0),
